      "side": 0,
      "message": "Yes, looks like this one\u0027s a bit iffy. Locally I set CONFIG_SOC_TEGRA_CBB to m in our fragment config, which would still evaluate to true in the `ifdef CONFIG_SOC_TEGRA_CBB`, so I think removing the config entirely would make cbb unavailable, but setting it to m still allows it to be built as built-in (even though we\u0027d expect it to be module in that case)",
      "parentUuid": "b8bfce86_22554320",
      "revId": "7e0958a8f38991a9d3f7edb75863e7f440826114",
